OL,3,AVeteran BBC Africa correspondent Mark
OL,4,ADoyle dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish journalist Mark Doyle, best
OL,7,Fknown for his reporting on conflicts in
OL,8,FAfrica in the 1990s and 2000s, has died
OL,9,Fafter a short illness.
OL,11,FAfter living in Africa, he joined the
OL,12,FBBC in 1986. Doyle became East Africa
OL,13,Fcorrespondent in 1993 and made his mark
OL,14,Fcovering the Rwandan genocide a year
OL,15,Flater.
OL,17,FAs West Africa correspondent from 1997
OL,18,Fto 2002, he reported on Sierra Leone's
OL,19,Fbrutal civil war and aftermath of
OL,20,FLiberia's conflict.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
